1
00:03:34,285 --> 00:03:40,285
Join Barbie as Elina in an all-new Fairytopia adventure!

2
00:07:08,571 --> 00:07:14,571
Barbie Fairytopia: Magic of the Rainbow is a animation,
family, fantasy film directed by William Lau.

3
00:10:42,857 --> 00:10:48,857
Elina goes to a fairy school to learn dancing and fairy magic.

4
00:14:17,142 --> 00:14:23,142
The spring of the fairy land is soon threatened by evil Laverna who intends to
prevent fairies from performing the annual vital rainbow dance.

5
00:17:51,428 --> 00:17:57,428
Elina must stop quarreling with her fellow students and
unite them to save the first bud of the spring.

6
00:21:25,714 --> 00:21:31,714
Elina (voice), played by Kelly Sheridan.

7
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Bibble / Fungus #1 & #2 (voice), played by Lee Tockar.

8
00:28:34,285 --> 00:28:40,285
Laverna (voice), played by Kathleen Barr.

9
00:32:08,571 --> 00:32:14,571
Fungus Maximus (voice), played by Christopher Gaze.

10
00:35:42,857 --> 00:35:48,857
Dandelion / Topaz (voice), played by Tabitha St. Germain.

11
00:39:17,142 --> 00:39:23,142
Azura / Pixie #1 (voice), played by Venus Terzo.

12
00:42:51,428 --> 00:42:57,428
Barbie Fairytopia: Magic of the Rainbow, also known as Barbie: Magic of the Rainbow is a 2007 animated fantasy film
directed by William Lau and written by Elise Allen that released direct-to-video on March 17, 2007.

13
00:46:25,714 --> 00:46:31,714
It was distributed internationally through Universal Pictures Video.

14
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
It is the tenth installment in the Barbie film series and the
third film in the Barbie: Fairytopia trilogy.

15
00:53:34,285 --> 00:53:40,285
The film follows Elina, who is chosen to attend fairy school at the
Crystal Palace as an apprentice of the Guardian fairy Azura.

16
00:57:08,571 --> 00:57:14,571
Elina and the six other apprentices will prepare for the annual spring ritual, the
"Flight of Spring", that produces the first rainbow of the season.

17
01:00:42,857 --> 01:00:48,857
The antagonist of the series, Laverna, is planning to stop the
rite and plunge Fairytopia into ten years of winter.

18
01:04:17,142 --> 01:04:23,142
Elina must work together with the apprentices to
defeat Laverna and save Fairytopia.

19
01:07:51,428 --> 01:07:57,428
The film explores themes of magic, fairy, based on
toy, female protagonist, magic land.

20
01:11:25,714 --> 01:11:31,714
The tone is emotional.
